cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the aggregate results, please cite the archived version."
title: "Lipids do not support stand-alone, transportable risk stratification for diabetic retinopathy: a four-layer evaluation, with a cautionary finding on outcome misclassification"
abstract: "Analysis code, figure/table-generation scripts and de-identified aggregate outputs supporting a four-layer evaluation of whether lipids can support a stand-alone, transportable diabetic-retinopathy risk tool. The repository contains no manuscript text and no individual-level data."
